Package: mistralOCR
Title: Extract Tables from PDFs Using the Mistral OCR API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sarah", "Elmendorf", email = "sarah.elmendorf@colorado.edu",
  role = c("aut", "cre"),
  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1085-8521"))
Description: Submits local or remote PDFs to the Mistral OCR API, parses
    returned markdown tables into tibbles, extracts per-cell confidence
    scores, and provides a Shiny app for interactive extraction. Much of
    the code/documentation was vibe coded from AI tools. The outputs have been
    only partially vetted. Use at your own risk.
